# Release: dead code elimination, no traces, no source map.
#
# A separate file rather than extra flags on top of the development build, so
# `haxe build.release.hxml` is the whole story and there is no way to ship a
# debug bundle by forgetting one. A source map in particular cannot be turned
# off once build.hxml has turned it on, which is why neither file includes the
# other.

lib/wisdom-kit/kit.hxml
--class-path src
--main app.Main

--dce full
-D no-traces
--js dist/web/frontend.js
